                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "128751338",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197994002775",
                            "num_reviews": 1526,
                            "playtime_forever": 187,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 187,
                            "last_played": 1667691674
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Operation Warcade VR will let you experience the game in an immersive and chaotic way. What is awesome is that you can enter the battlefield and use war vehicles. This game is a lot of fun & action!\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7jm5T_W_LlA\n\nOperation Warcade is a VR shooter that tries to bring back that gaming nostalgia by taking you to a classic virtual game arcade from the 80s and otherwise succeeds nicely.\nWith the variety offered by the two game modes, along with the challenges, achievements, unlocks and a ranking system, there is plenty of opportunity to get hours and hours of gameplay out of this game.\n\nAs you progress through the levels and take down enemies, you will also see a variety of special items that must be shot in order to be collected or activated. This includes special grenades that explode in strange and wonderful ways, other weapons like another dual-purpose Uzi, and the ultimate monkey - an immersion point that takes you into the real game.\nThe two Operation Warcade machines offer a different experience depending on which one you play. While they both use the same level design and maps, the gameplay is slightly different.",
